<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">RRK63.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha y'okubanza eyaahandiikirwe Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA Y'OKUBANZA EYAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHAANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Okukwatanisa kwa Ruhanga n'omuntu ahabwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yoh 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyabaire kiriho iranaira, eki twahuriire, eki twareebire n'amaisho gaitu, eki twayetegyereize kandi tukakwataho n'engaro zaitu, ekya kigambo ow'amagara <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Yoh 1:4</ref>. </char></note> (kandi amagara ago gakoorekwa, twagareeba, twagahamya, kandi nitubagambira amagara ago agatahwaho agaabaire gari na Isheboona gakatworekwa) <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />eki twareebire kandi eki twahuriire, nikyo turikubagambira ngu naimwe mukwatanise naitwe; kandi naitwe tukwataniise na isheboona n'Omwana we Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:11">Yoh 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:24">16:24</ref>. </char></note> kandi nitubahandiikira ebyo ngu okushemererwa kwaitu kube okuhikire.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu nibwo butumwa obu yaatugambiire, kandi obu turikubagambira, ngu Ruhanga n'omushana, kandi omuriwe tiharimu mwirima na kakye. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:4">1 Yoh 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Ku turaabe nitugira ngu nitukwatanisa nawe, haza kunu nitugyendera omu mwirima, biri nitubeiha kandi titurikukora by'amazima; <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb 9:14</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku tugyendera omu mushana, nka We oku ari omu mushana, tukwatanisa hamwe, kandi eshagama ya yesu Kristo Omwana we eguma neetwozyaho ebibi byona. <verse eid="1JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Ku tugira ngu titwine kibi, tuba nitwebeiha, kandi tuba tutaine mazima. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Ku twatura ebibi byaitu, niwe w'okwesigwa kandi ohikiriire kutusaasira ebibi n'okutwozyaho eby'okutahikiirira byona. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Ku tugira ngu titukashiishaga, tumuhindura omubeihi, kandi ekigambo kye kiba kitari muriitwe.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 7:25">Heb 7:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baana bangye abato, naabahandiikira ebigambo ebyo, ngu murekye kushiisha; kwonka omuntu weena ku araashiishe, twine Omutonganizi ahari Isheboona, niwe Yesu Kristo ohikiriire; <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:51">Yoh 11:51</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:52">52</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ogwo niwe karabo ahabw'ebibi byaitu, kandi ti byaitu twenka, kureka n'ebibi by'ensi yoona. <verse eid="1JN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Ahari eki niho turikuhamiza ngu nitumumanya, ku turaabe nitukora ebi aturagiira. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Orikugira ati, Nimmumanya, atarikworobera biragiro bye, n'omubeihi, kandi naaba ataine mazima; <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yoh 14:23</ref>. </char></note> kwonka orikworobera ekigambo kye, okukunda oku akunda Ruhanga kuba kuhikiriziibwe buzima omuriwe. Aho niho tumanyira ku turi omuriwe; <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />orikugira ngu atuura omuriwe, ashemereire kutwaza nka We oku yaabaire atwaza.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Abarikukundwa, tindikubahandiikira kiragiro kisya, kureka ekya ira, eki mwabaire mwine okwiha iranaira; ekiragiro ekyo ekya ira nikyo kigambo eki mwahuriire. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Rom 13:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka kandi nimbahandiikira ekiragiro kisya, kandi eky'amazima omuriwe n'omuriimwe, ahakuba omwirima niguhwaho, kandi n'omushana ogw'amazima gwajwire. <verse eid="1JN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:20">1 Yoh 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Orikugira ngu ari omu mushana, akanga mwene ishe, biri akiri omu mwirima na hati. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:13">Rom 14:13</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 14:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Orikukunda mwene ishe, naaba ari omu mushana, kandi omuriwe tiharimu kirikuteeza ntsibo. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:35">Yoh 12:35</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka orikwanga mwene ishe, naaba ari omu mwirima, kandi naaba atarikumanya i arikuza, ahabw'okuba omwirima niguba gumuhumize amaisho.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Nimbahandiikira, imwe abaana bato, ahakuba ebibi byanyu bibasaasiirwe ahabw'eiziina rye. <verse eid="1JN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Nimbahandiikira, imwe baishebo, ahakuba nimumanya Ogwo owaabaire ariho okwiha iranaira. Nimbahandiikira, imwe abatsigazi, ahakuba musingwire Omubi. Naabahandiikira, imwe abaana bato, ahakuba nimumanya Isheboona. <verse eid="1JN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:10">Efe 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Naabahandiikira, imwe baishebo, ahakuba nimumanya Ogwo owaabaire ariho okwiha iranaira. Naabahandiikira, imwe abatsigazi, ahakuba mwine amaani, n'ekigambo kya Ruhanga kituura omuriimwe, kandi musingwire Omubi.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okutakunda nsi erihwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 4:4">Yak 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutarikunda ensi n'obu byakuba ebintu ebigirimu. Omuntu weena ku akunda ensi, okukunda Isheboona kuba kutamurimu. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Ahakuba byona eby'omu nsi, ebi omubiri gwetenga, n'ebi amaisho geetenga, n'okwehimbisa ahabw'eby'amagara aga, tibiruga hari Isheboona, kureka biruga omu nsi egi. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:2">1 Pet 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ensi egi neehwaho n'okwetenga kwayo; kwonka okora ebi Ruhanga akunda, agumaho ebiro byona.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'orikwehindura Kristo kumurwanisa orikwetwa Antikristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Imwe abaana bato, ogu nigwo mwanya gw'aha muheru; nk'oku mwahuriire ngu nihenda kwija <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Antikristo, amakuru n'ekyebumbe ekirikweyeta Kristo. </char></note>Antikristo, na mbwenu haizire baantikristo baingi; aho niho turikumanyira omwanya ogu ku guri ogw'aha muheru. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:19">1 Kor 11:19</ref>. </char></note> Bakataana naitwe, baaturugamu; kwonka bakaba batari baitu; ahakuba kuri baabaire bari abaitu, bakaagumire naitwe; kwonka bakeegyendera, ngu kimanyirwe kimwe ku boona batari baitu. <verse eid="1JN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Kwonka imwe mukashukwaho amajuta Ogwo Orikwera, kandi mwena nimukimanya. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Tinaabahandiikira nk'abatarikumanya mazima, kureka nk'abarikugamanya, kandi nimumanya ngu tihariho kishuba ekiruga omu mazima. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Omubeihi n'oha? T'ogwo ohakana ku Yesu atari Kristo? Antikristo n'ogwo oyehakana Isheboona n'Omwana. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:23">Yoh 5:23</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho oyehakana Omwana akagira Isheboona. Ogwo oikiriza Omwana niwe aine na Isheboona. <verse eid="1JN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />N'ahabw'ekyo eki mwahuriire okwiha iranaira kibe nikyo kyaguma omuriimwe. Eki mwahuriire okwiha iranaira ku kiriguma omuriimwe, naimwe muryaguma omu Mwana n'omuri Isheboona. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Kandi endagaano ei yaaturaganiise n'egi, okuheebwa amagara agatahwaho.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Ebi naabibahandiikira kubamanyisa eby'abarikwenda kubahabisa; <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Yer 31:34</ref>. </char></note> naimwe okushukwaho amajuta, oku yaabahaire, nikuguma omuriimwe, kandi timurikwetenga w'okubeegyesa; nk'okushukaho amajuta kwe oku kubeegyesa ahari byona, kandi oku kuri okw'amazima, kutari kw'ebishuba, nk'oku kwabeegyeise, mube nikwo mwaguma omuriwe. <verse eid="1JN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:17">1 Yoh 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Na mbwenu, baana bangye abato, mugume omuriwe, bwanyima ku arireebeka, tubone kwija omu maisho ge twine obumanzi, tutarikukwatwa nshoni tukeenyonya aha kwija kwe. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:10">1 Yoh 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraabe nimumanya ngu ahikiriire, mumanye ngu omuntu weena okora eby'okuhikiirira biri azairwe Ruhanga.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abaana ba Ruhanga n'abaana ba Sitaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yoh 1:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mureebe okukunda oku Isheboona yaatukunzire oku kuri, itwe okwetwa abaana ba Ruhanga; kandi nikwo turi. Nikyo ensi etatumanyira, ahakuba teramumanyire. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:21">Fil 3:21</ref>. </char></note> Abarikukundwa, hati turi abaana ba Ruhanga; oku turiba, tikukamanyirwe; kwonka nitumanya, ngu ku arishuuruurwa, turyashushana nawe, ahabw'okuba turyamureeba nk'oku ari. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Kandi omuntu weena omwineho amatsiko ago, ayeshemeze nka We oku ari oshemeire.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Omuntu weena okora ekibi akora eby'obugomi; kandi ekibi nibwo bugomi. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu Ogwo akoorekwa kwihaho ebibi, kandi omuriwe tiharimu kibi. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:14">Rom 6:14</ref>. </char></note> Weena oguma omuriwe tashiisha; weena oshiisha takamureebaga, n'obu kwakuba okumumanya. <verse eid="1JN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Imwe abaana bato, hatagira omuntu weena owaabahabya. Okora eby'okuhikiirira niwe ahikiriire, nka We oku ahikiriire. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:44">Yoh 8:44</ref>. </char></note> Okora ekibi n'owa Sitaane; ahakuba okwiha iranaira Sitaane ashiisha. Nikyo Omwana wa Ruhanga yaayorekyeirwe kuhwerekyereza emirimo ya Sitaane. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:18">1 Yoh 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Weena ozairwe Ruhanga takora kibi; ahabw'okuba embibo ye eguma omuriwe; kandi tabaasa kukora kibi, ahakuba akazaarwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Ekyo nikyo kimanyisa abaana ba Ruhanga n'abaana ba Sitaane; weena otakora eby'okuhikiirira ti wa Ruhanga, n'obu yaakuba otakunda mwene ishe.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukundana n'okwangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoh 13:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba obu nibwo butumwa obu mwahuriire okwiha iranaira, ngu tukundane, <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Kut 4:8</ref>. </char></note> turekye kuba nka Kaini owaabaire ari ow'Omubi, akaita omurumuna. Mbwenu akamwitira ki? Ahabw'okuba emicwe ye ekaba eri mibi, kandi ey'omurumuna ekaba eri ey'ohikiriire. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:18">Yoh 15:18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:19">19</ref>. </char></note> B'eishe-emwe, mutatangaara ngu ensi neebanga. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yoh 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Itwe nitumanya ngu tukaruga omu kufa, twataaha omu magara, ahabw'okuba tukunda ab'eishe-emwe. Otaine rukundo aguma omu kufa. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat 5:21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Weena orikwanga mwene ishe n'omwitsi; kandi nimumanya ngu tihariho mwitsi oine amagara agatahwaho omuriwe. <verse eid="1JN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:13">Yoh 15:13</ref>. </char></note> Aha niho tumanyira rukundo, ahakuba Yesu akahayo amagara ge ahabwaitu; naitwe tushemereire kuhayo amagara gaitu ahabwa beene waitu. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:7">Bir 15:7</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu omuntu weena otungire ebintu by'ensi egi, ku yaakureeba mugyenzi we abikyenire, yaamwehuzya, okukunda kwa Ruhanga kukaaguma kuta omuriwe? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:15">Yak 2:15</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 2:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Baana bato, turekye kukundana omu bigambo nari aha rurimi, kureka tukundane omu bi turikukora n'omu mazima.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Aha niho turikumanyira ku turi ab'amazima, tukagarukwamu emitima omu maisho ge, <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />omuri byona ebi etushinja; ahakuba Ruhanga ni mukuru okukira emitima yaitu, kandi naamanya byona. <verse eid="1JN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Abarikukundwa, emitima yaitu ku eraabe etarikutushinja, twine obumanzi omu maisho ga Ruhanga; <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:24">Mak 11:24</ref>. </char></note> kandi eki tushaba kyona akituha, ahakuba tworobera ebiragiro bye, kandi tukora ebishemeire omu maisho ge. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:29">Yoh 6:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eki nikyo kiragiro kye, ngu twikirize eiziina ry'Omwana we Yesu Kristo, kandi tukundane nk'oku yaaturagiire. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:4">Yoh 15:4</ref>. </char></note> Boona aboorobera ebiragiro bye baguma omuriwe, nawe aguma omuribo. Kandi aha niho tumanyira ngu aguma omuriitwe, ahabw'Omwoyo ou yaatuhaire.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Emyoyo ey'amazima n'ey'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:21">1 Tes 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mat 7:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikukundwa, mutaikiriza buri mwoyo gwona, kureka mubanze mwetegyereze emyoyo ku eraabe eri eya Ruhanga; ahakuba baanabi baingi ab'ebishuba baizire omu nsi. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:3">1 Kor 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Aha niho tumanyira Omwoyo wa Ruhanga; buri mwoyo gwona ogugamba ku Yesu Kristo yaiziire omu mubiri, guba niguruga ahari Ruhanga; <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:18">1 Yoh 2:18</ref>. </char></note> kandi omwoyo gwona ogutagamba Yesu gutyo, guba gutari gwa Ruhanga. Ogwo n'omwoyo gwa antikristo ogu mwahuriire ngu nigwija, kandi na hati gwahikire omu nsi. <verse eid="1JN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:29">Mat 12:29</ref>. </char></note> Imwe abaana bato, muri aba Ruhanga, kandi mubasingwire, ahakuba Ori omuriimwe ni mukuru okukira ori omu nsi. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Bo n'ab'ensi; n'ahabw'ekyo nibagamba eby'ensi kandi n'ensi neebahurira. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:47">Yoh 8:47</ref>. </char></note> Itwe turi aba Ruhanga. Omuntu weena omanya Ruhanga atuhurira; kandi otari wa Ruhanga tatuhurira. Aho niho tumanyira omwoyo ogw'amazima, n'omwoyo ogurikuhabya.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga ni rukundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Abarikukundwa, tukundane, ahakuba okukunda kuruga ahari Ruhanga, kandi omuntu weena ogira rukundo aba azairwe Ruhanga. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Otagira rukundo tamanya Ruhanga; ahakuba Ruhanga aba rukundo. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yoh 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Omuri eki nimwo okukunda kwa Ruhanga kwayorekyeirwe ahariitwe, obu yaatuma Omwana we omwe nyamunegyere, ngu tube abahuriire ahabwe. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Omuri eki nimwo okukunda kuri, tiitwe twakunzire Ruhanga, kureka niwe yaatukunzire, akatuma Omwana we kuba ekarabo ahabw'ebibi byaitu. <verse eid="1JN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Abarikukundwa, Ruhanga ku araabe yaatukunzire atyo, naitwe tushemereire kukundana. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yoh 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho muntu orareebire Ruhanga; ku tukundana, Ruhanga aguma omuriitwe, n'okukunda kwe kuhikiirizibwa omuriitwe.<verse eid="1JN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuguma omuri Ruhanga, nawe omuriitwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Aha niho tumanyira ngu tuguma omuriwe, nawe omuriitwe, ahabw'okuba akatuha aha Mwoyo we. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Yoh 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Itwe tukareeba kandi twahamya ku Isheboona yaatumire Omwana we kuba Omujuni w'ensi. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:5">1 Yoh 5:5</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena orikumanya ku Yesu ari Omwana wa Ruhanga, Ruhanga naaguma omuriwe, kandi nawe naaguma omuri Ruhanga. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Itwe nitumanya, kandi nitwikiriza okukunda oku Ruhanga atukunda. Ruhanga ni rukundo; kandi oguma omuri rukundo niwe aguma omuri Ruhanga, na Ruhanga akaguma omuriwe. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Omuri eki nimwo okukunda kuhikiirizibwa omuriitwe, ngu tugire obumanzi tutaritiina aha kiro ky'orubanja, ahakuba nk'oku ari nikwo naitwe turi omu nsi egi. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Omu kukunda tihabamu bwoba, okukunda okuhikire kubingira aheeru obwoba; ahakuba obwoba bugyenda n'ekiheneso, kandi oine obwoba aba ataine kukunda okuhikire. <verse eid="1JN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Itwe nitukunda, ahakuba We akabanza kutukunda. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Omuntu weena ku agira ati, Ninkunda Ruhanga, haza naayanga mugyenzi we, n'omubeihi; ahakuba otakunda mugyenzi we ou arareebire, tabaasa kukunda Ruhanga ou atakareebaga. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:29-31">Mak 12:29-31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi twine ekiragiro eki ekyarugire ahariwe ngu, Orikukunda Ruhanga akunde na mugyenzi we.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okunda Ruhanga ayorobera ebiragiro bye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Omuntu weena oikiriza ngu Yesu ni Kristo aba azairwe Ruhanga; kandi weena okunda omuzaire aba naakunda n'ou yaazaire. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Aha niho turikumanyira ngu tukunda abaana ba Ruhanga, ku tukunda Ruhanga, twayorobera ebiragiro bye. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yoh 14:23</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 14:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:30">Mat 11:30</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba oku nikwo kukunda Ruhanga, itwe okworobera ebiragiro bye; kandi ebiragiro bye tibirusya. <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:33">Yoh 16:33</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba kyona ekizairwe Ruhanga kisingura ensi; kandi obu nibwo businguzi obusingura ensi, nikwo kwikiriza kwaitu. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Mbwenu n'oha osingura ensi? T'ogwo oikiriza ngu Yesu n'Omwana wa Ruhanga? <verse eid="1JN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:34">Yoh 19:34</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo niwe yaizire, akaraba omu maizi n'eshagama, Yesu Kristo, ti mu maizi gonka, kureka omu maizi n'eshagama; <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />kandi Omwoyo niwe abihamya, ahabw'okuba Omwoyo nigo mazima. <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Hariho ebirikuhamya bishatu, Omwoyo n'amaizi n'eshagama; kandi ebishatu ebyo biikirizana. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:32">Yoh 5:32</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Ku turaabe nitwikiriza okuhamya kw'abantu, okuhamya kwa Ruhanga nikukira okwabo; ahakuba okuhamya kwa Ruhanga nikwo oku, ngu akahamya eby'Omwana we. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:16">Rom 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Oikiriza Omwana wa Ruhanga aine okuhamya okwo omuriwe. Otaikiriza Ruhanga aba amuhindwire omubeihi, ahabw'okuba aba ataikiriize kuhamya oku Ruhanga yaahamize aha Mwana we. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Kandi oku nikwo kuhamya okwo, ngu Ruhanga akatuha amagara agatahwaho, kandi amagara ago gari omu Mwana we. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Yoh 3:36</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu oine ogwo Mwana niwe aine amagara; otaine Mwana wa Ruhanga taine magara. <verse eid="1JN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">Yoh 20:31</ref>. </char></note> Ebi naabihandiikira imwe abaikiriza eiziina ry'Omwana wa Ruhanga, ngu mubone kumanya ku mwine amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:22">1 Yoh 3:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obu nibwo bumanzi obu twine omuriwe, ngu kutushaba ekintu kyona nk'oku akunda, atuhurira. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Kandi ku turaabe nitumanya ngu atuhurira omuri byona ebi tushaba, nitumanya ngu tutungire ebi twamushabire. <verse eid="1JN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:31">Mat 12:31</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku araareebe mugyenzi we naakora ekibi ekitari ky'okumwitsa, ashabe, kandi Ruhanga aryamuha amagara ahabw'abo abakozire ekibi ekitari ky'okubaitsa. Hariho ekibi ekirikwitsa; ekyo tindikugira ngu, aryakyeshengyerereza. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Ekitari ky'okuhikiirira kyona kiba ekibi; kwonka hariho ekibi ekitari ky'okwitsa.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Nitumanya ngu omuntu weena ozairwe Ruhanga takora kibi; ahakuba Ogwo owaazairwe Ruhanga niwe amurinda, kandi Omubi tamukoraho. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Itwe nitumanya ku turi aba Ruhanga, kandi ensi yoona ku eri omu butegyeki bw'Omubi ogwo. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:3">Yoh 17:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nitumanya ngu Omwana wa Ruhanga akaija, yaatuha okwetegyereza, ngu tumanye Ow'amazima; naitwe turi omuri Ogwo ow'amazima, niwe Yesu Kristo Omwana we. Ogwo niwe Ruhanga ow'amazima, n'amagara, agatahwaho. <verse eid="1JN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:14">1 Kor 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Imwe baana bato 'mwe, mwerinde ebishushani ebirikuramibwa.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>